title: Player flow, hello to role (contract v4, 2026-10-08)

participants: Tuneshroom, Arco, Control

# Connect. Control offers "game" on Arco's hub as an o2lite guest.
Tuneshroom -> Arco: /game/hello dev name proto instrument
Arco -> Control: /game/hello
Control -> Arco: /ie1/room (first contact only)
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/room
note: heartbeat: /game/beat every 1 s, each answered /ie1/beat seq epoch (legacy: hello every 5 s, no reply)

# Invite. SETUP, round set, lobby not FULL: repeats every 5 s until validated.
Control -> Arco: /ie1/handshake round (TCP)
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/handshake
Control -> Arco: /ie1/leds white invite flash x2
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/leds
note: user double-taps (accept)
Tuneshroom -> Arco: /game/handshake dev round node
Arco -> Control: /game/handshake
Control -> Arco: /ie1/validated round role (TCP)
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/validated
note: over cap: /ie1/deny "scored full" then jam role at start
note: stale round: dropped

# Ceremony. One reserved slot per validation, spaced 1s apart.
Control -> Arco: /ie1/leds green flash x2
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/leds
note: a Room fixture bell climbs the A major scale on Control's own Arco voice
Control -> Arco: /ie1/play chime key=<midi>
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/play

# Start. One decider; the ceremony's queued cues survive a fast start.
note: start (timer, operator, admin, /game/start)
Control -> Arco: /ie1/role scored (TCP)
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/role
note: every other pooled device gets /<dev>/role jam here

# Play. Gesture in, timed frames out.
Tuneshroom -> Arco: /game/tap
Arco -> Control: /game/tap
Control -> Arco: /ie1/leds at = origin + cue_horizon
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/leds

# Completion. Release arrives after the closing fade, not at Bit end.
Control -> Arco: /ie1/release (TCP)
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/release
